# Moves the limit of IndexSummaryBuilder.java:204 to 8 MiB (case 9c): getEntrySize(DecoratedKey), whose only caller is :204,
# returns its value plus 2^31 - 1 - 8 MiB = 2139095039, so the comparison reads entries.length() + K + 8 <= 8388608.
RULE moved limit 8 MiB
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.io.sstable.indexsummary.IndexSummaryBuilder
METHOD getEntrySize(org.apache.cassandra.db.DecoratedKey)
AT EXIT
IF true
DO return $! + 2139095039
ENDRULE
